    "introduction": "IG Group provides online trading and investment services to customers in several international markets. Its offerings include derivatives trading, share dealing and other investment products, with platforms serving different customer needs and regulatory environments. Revenue comes from trading-related charges, spreads and other income associated with client activity and balances. Technology reliability, execution and access to markets are central to the customer proposition. The business is influenced by market volatility and client engagement, but also requires careful management of exposures and operational systems. Regulation governs product availability and customer protections, while acquiring and retaining active clients is important to commercial performance.",
